n/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L309-L317","doc":"On level `n` of the Coxeter tower the trace is the level trace pulled back along `e_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace_g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace_g","kind":"theorem","line":301,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L301-L307","doc":"`g n` is the §7a balanced generator `σ_n = q⁻¹·T_n` of `HeckeAlgebra K (q*q) (Aₙ (n+1))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace_H","kind":"theorem","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L285-L299","doc":"`H n` is the image of level `n` of the **Coxeter** tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.braidedTower_coxeter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.braidedTower_coxeter","kind":"instance","line":282,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L282-L283","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxeterMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L278-L280","doc":"**The Ocneanu (tensor-model) Markov trace on the Coxeter-presentation Hecke tower.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.colimEquiv_ofLim","@type":"LeanDecl