ancedEquiv_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.skeinBalancedEquiv_σ","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L141-L147","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxIncl_T","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxIncl_T","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L133-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxIncl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.coxIncl","kind":"def","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L123-L131","doc":"**The Coxeter-side tower map** `HeckeAlgebra K Q (Aₙ n) →ₐ HeckeAlgebra K Q (Aₙ (n+1))`,\n`Tᵢ ↦ T_{castSucc i}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.AMat_castSucc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.AMat_castSucc","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L116-L119","doc":"The `Aₙ` entries depend only on index values, so they are stable under `castSucc`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.braidedTower_transport","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.braidedTower_transport","kind":"instance","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L97-L110","doc":"The braid-tower relations move along the equivalence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.transportMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.CoxeterTower.transportMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/CoxeterTower.lean#L66-L95","doc":"A `MarkovTrace` on `A` gives one on any `B ≃ₐ[R] A`-equivalent algebra. ","signatureChunk":0}]}